"description":"Who's the imposter among your friends?\nImposter is the ultimate party game of bluffing, guessing, and social deduction. Grab 3-5 friends, sit around one device, and find out who’s lying.\n\nHow to Play:\n1- All players see the same secret word—except one.\n2- The imposter only sees the word “Imposter.”\n3- One by one, players say a word related to the secret word.\n4- The imposter must fake it and try to blend in without knowing the word.\n5- Keep giving words and talking until someone thinks they've figured it out.\n\nFun, fast, and full of suspicion—perfect for game nights, road trips, or hanging out with friends.\n\nFeatures:\n- Play locally with 3 to 15 friends\n- 10+ categories like food, movies, jobs, and more\n- 500+ unique words and growing\n- No accounts, no setup—just start playing\n- Great for all ages—kids, teens, and adults\n\nBuilt for laughs, bluffing, and epic \"aha!\" moments\n\nDownload now and start your next Imposter showdown!\n\nhttps://imposterwho.com/terms\nhttps://imposterwho.com/privacy", "minimumOsVersion":"15.1", "userRatingCount":30613}]
